@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
':ui-svc: as uisvc
:config-svc:  as confsvc
:state-svc:  as statesvc
:task-executor-svc(1..n):  as taskexecutorsvc
:scheduler-svc: as schedulersvc
:task-proxy-for-spark: as sparkproxy
':cmd-cli: as cmdcli

'scheduler requests task details and source configuration from config-svc
schedulersvc -> confsvc : getEffectiveTaskDTO / getSourceConfDTO
'task-executor locks/heartbeats/releases tasks in scheduler-svc
schedulersvc <-- taskexecutorsvc : lockTaskById / lockHeartBeat / lockRelease
'task-executor fetches source configuration
taskexecutorsvc --> confsvc : getSourceConfDTO
'task-executor maintains dataset interval states
taskexecutorsvc --> statesvc : setDataSetStateDTO / getWrongStateByInterval
'task-executor submits spark jobs via REST /v1/submissions (directly or through the proxy)
taskexecutorsvc --> sparkproxy : spark submit REST /v1/submissions
sparkproxy ---> (sparkclusters) : spark-submit (standalone/k8s/yarn)
note bottom of confsvc
  vcs-svc is planned but not implemented yet.
  It will be responsible for importing configurations into config-svc.
end note
@enduml